WEBVTT

01:00.100 --> 01:02.900
=Daughter of Fortune=

01:02.900 --> 01:05.460
(Adapted from the novel
"Phoenix Palace Dream" by Lan Jiujiu)

01:05.540 --> 01:08.460
=Episode 7=

01:10.959 --> 01:12.120
Miss Shen,

01:12.239 --> 01:13.319
you are also named Shen

01:13.680 --> 01:14.920
and are from Chizhou.

01:15.400 --> 01:16.760
Do you happen to know

01:17.319 --> 01:18.280
Senior Attendant Rou?

01:25.040 --> 01:27.280
Senior Attendant Rou
is my younger concubine-born sister.

01:32.319 --> 01:33.319
Greetings, Nanqiao.

01:33.959 --> 01:34.719
Zhinian.

01:39.280 --> 01:39.959
Young Master Lu.

01:40.920 --> 01:41.719
Greetings,

01:43.040 --> 01:44.000
Senior Attendant Rou.

01:45.120 --> 01:47.599
Indeed, she has
an extraordinary appearance.

01:49.200 --> 01:50.110
Since we were young,

01:50.120 --> 01:51.990
my sister has always
been prettier than I am.

01:52.200 --> 01:54.120
She is also more ambitious than me.

01:54.760 --> 01:57.439
She only chooses
the most outstanding men to marry.

02:01.840 --> 02:03.159
I have misspoken.

02:04.120 --> 02:05.480
What did you do wrong?

02:05.640 --> 02:06.920
When it comes to marriage,

02:06.920 --> 02:08.680
one should follow parents' orders

02:08.680 --> 02:09.840
and the matchmaker's words.

02:10.000 --> 02:11.199
You have done very well.

02:12.520 --> 02:13.439
Shen Zhinian,

02:13.919 --> 02:15.479
you must learn to be content.

02:15.560 --> 02:17.240
Follow the palace rules

02:17.240 --> 02:18.639
and serve the Emperor well.

02:19.000 --> 02:20.790
I will follow your teachings,
Dowager Consort.

02:21.919 --> 02:23.879
Now that my wishes have come true,

02:23.960 --> 02:25.280
it's all thanks to Nanqiao.

02:25.840 --> 02:26.759
Thank you, Nanqiao.

02:27.360 --> 02:28.120
Zhinian,

02:28.800 --> 02:30.520
we can catch up

02:30.520 --> 02:31.759
on our sisterly bond later.

02:33.520 --> 02:34.120
Emperor,

02:34.680 --> 02:37.120
I wish to adopt
Nanqiao as my goddaughter.

02:37.240 --> 02:38.400
What do you think?

02:41.400 --> 02:42.960
(The younger sister entered the palace)

02:43.100 --> 02:45.100
(and the elder sister
saved the Dowager Consort.)

02:46.400 --> 02:47.840
(What a perfect collaboration.)

02:48.160 --> 02:49.520
Whatever you say, Dowager Consort.

02:50.039 --> 02:50.919
Alright.

02:52.240 --> 02:54.719
Then, you will be granted the title of
County Princess Ning'an,

02:55.280 --> 02:57.159
and you will reside in Qingquan Palace.

02:58.100 --> 02:59.860
- Thank you, Your Majesty.
- Thank you, Your Majesty.

02:59.879 --> 03:01.660
- Thank you, Dowager Consort.
- Thank you, Dowager Consort.

03:02.120 --> 03:03.560
(I never expected)

03:03.719 --> 03:05.960
(that Shen Nanqiao
would dare to enter the palace.)

03:08.000 --> 03:10.250
The Dowager Consort was
originally going to Mount Ling,

03:10.560 --> 03:12.960
but she changed her route
to Nanhua Temple midway.

03:14.080 --> 03:15.919
Shen Nanqiao came to
the capital from Chizhou.

03:16.319 --> 03:17.680
On the way, there is Babao Temple,

03:17.680 --> 03:19.200
which is most popular with civilians,

03:19.400 --> 03:20.599
but she didn't go there.

03:21.280 --> 03:23.479
Instead, she took a detour
to Nanhua Temple.

03:23.919 --> 03:25.120
Was it a coincidence,

03:25.439 --> 03:26.439
or was it intentional?

03:27.039 --> 03:29.479
I think these two sisters
are both very suspicious.

03:30.520 --> 03:31.800
Keep a close eye on them.

03:32.039 --> 03:32.960
Find out the truth.

03:33.000 --> 03:33.680
Yes, Your Majesty.

03:33.680 --> 03:35.840
(Tinglan Palace)

03:35.840 --> 03:37.800
County Princess Ning'an has arrived!

03:42.280 --> 03:44.719
So, you live in such a remote place.

03:44.919 --> 03:46.840
Life here must be
very difficult for you.

03:47.319 --> 03:48.879
It's still better than being at home.

03:48.879 --> 03:50.060
After all, this is the palace.

03:50.280 --> 03:51.199
Otherwise,

03:51.439 --> 03:53.080
you wouldn't have followed me here.

03:56.000 --> 03:57.400
There's no need to pretend.

03:57.680 --> 03:58.919
Without power or influence,

03:59.120 --> 04:01.759
you are less than an ant in this palace.

04:02.639 --> 04:04.159
I am different.

04:04.160 --> 04:06.110
Lu has come to
the capital for the re-examination.

04:06.120 --> 04:07.240
He will surely pass.

04:07.360 --> 04:08.700
When he becomes the top scholar,

04:08.919 --> 04:10.240
I will be both a County Princess

04:10.400 --> 04:11.840
and the top scholar's wife.

04:13.479 --> 04:14.840
We both come from the Shen family.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.040
We are tied together.

04:16.360 --> 04:17.560
If you live well,

04:17.600 --> 04:19.100
it's good for the Shen family and me.

04:19.240 --> 04:20.600
You want to benefit from me?

04:21.199 --> 04:21.839
Likewise,

04:22.439 --> 04:23.519
if you make a mistake,

04:23.600 --> 04:25.200
it will implicate the whole Shen family.

04:25.600 --> 04:27.399
I hope you think clearly

04:27.759 --> 04:28.920
before you do anything.

04:29.199 --> 04:30.199
What do you mean?

04:30.639 --> 04:31.519
I'm busy.

04:31.720 --> 04:33.480
County Princess Ning'an,
Young Master Lu,

04:33.680 --> 04:34.480
please leave.

04:36.800 --> 04:37.800
Let's go.

04:40.500 --> 04:42.360
My father-in-law
asked me to give this to you.

04:42.600 --> 04:43.240
Don't be afraid.

04:43.839 --> 04:44.560
Lu,

04:44.600 --> 04:45.360
let's go.

04:49.070 --> 04:50.360
Stop pretending to be so devoted.

04:50.490 --> 04:52.519
He turned around and
married Shen Nanqiao anyway.

04:52.519 --> 04:54.270
If he were truly noble,
he shouldn't have married anyone.

04:54.319 --> 04:56.319
(Lu Jianglin's loss of composure today)

04:56.319 --> 04:58.100
(must have been noticed
by someone with intent.)

04:58.120 --> 04:59.560
(I must be extra careful.)

05:18.759 --> 05:20.759
County Princess Ning'an
came from Chizhou.

05:20.760 --> 05:22.500
She should have
taken the Xu County route.

05:22.839 --> 05:24.560
Why would she take
a detour to Mount Wei?

05:26.920 --> 05:29.720
(Why does he look even more terrifying
than in my past life?)

05:33.240 --> 05:37.399
I went to Nanhua Temple
to pray for my husband,

05:37.400 --> 05:38.950
hoping he would pass the imperial exam.

05:39.279 --> 05:42.279
Nanqiao is gentle and virtuous.

05:43.360 --> 05:46.399
It's just a pity
that such a beautiful flower

05:46.759 --> 05:48.720
has fallen into an ordinary family.

05:49.240 --> 05:50.839
You are too kind, Dowager Consort.

05:50.920 --> 05:53.279
I am merely of humble appearance.

05:53.839 --> 05:55.800
I cannot compare to Zhinian's beauty.

05:56.079 --> 05:57.959
I heard from Nanqiao's maid

05:58.000 --> 06:00.279
that Nanqiao was originally
the one to enter the palace.

06:00.399 --> 06:02.360
It was Shen Zhinian who made a scene,

06:02.360 --> 06:04.720
insisting on breaking
the engagement with Lu Jianglin

06:04.879 --> 06:06.480
because she wanted to become a consort.

06:06.839 --> 06:08.480
Nanqiao felt

06:08.600 --> 06:09.879
indebted to Jianglin,

06:10.040 --> 06:12.079
which is why she
was willing to marry him.

06:12.759 --> 06:13.560
Your Majesty,

06:14.040 --> 06:15.319
Shen Zhinian

06:15.560 --> 06:16.680
is no saint.

06:20.959 --> 06:21.680
Your Majesty,

06:22.000 --> 06:23.680
my sister's love for wealth and status

06:24.040 --> 06:25.199
is not exactly a sin.

06:26.040 --> 06:26.839
Mm.

06:27.399 --> 06:28.600
County Princess, you're right.

06:29.439 --> 06:31.519
It's not a crime for a woman

06:31.530 --> 06:32.439
to seek a good husband.

06:34.040 --> 06:34.560
Your Majesty,

06:35.000 --> 06:36.600
have you taken a liking to Shen Zhinian?

06:37.330 --> 06:39.180
The County Princess
saved your life, Dowager Consort.

06:39.199 --> 06:41.360
So, I cannot mistreat her family.

06:42.800 --> 06:44.319
I will grant Shen Zhinian the title

06:44.759 --> 06:45.600
of Lady of Beauty

06:46.000 --> 06:47.800
to demonstrate your virtue,
Dowager Consort.

06:48.079 --> 06:50.079
A promotion of four ranks without merit?

06:50.920 --> 06:51.759
That is improper.

06:53.600 --> 06:55.000
What do you think, County Princess?

06:57.519 --> 06:59.360
There is no need for such

06:59.680 --> 07:01.240
generosity.

07:07.519 --> 07:09.720
I heard you once had
an engagement with Lu Jianglin.

07:14.550 --> 07:16.199
Looking at your expression,
Your Majesty,

07:16.199 --> 07:17.800
could I be so bold

07:18.040 --> 07:19.480
as to think you are jealous?

07:20.199 --> 07:21.399
Me, jealous?

07:22.519 --> 07:24.160
You think too highly of yourself, no?

07:25.040 --> 07:26.360
I've always been broad-minded,

07:26.439 --> 07:27.860
so I love thinking highly of myself.

07:27.879 --> 07:29.959
I didn't like the poor scholar
my father chose.

07:30.120 --> 07:31.900
I only love a majestic man
like Your Majesty.

07:32.160 --> 07:33.879
What a blatant gold-digger.

07:35.120 --> 07:36.519
In this world,

07:37.120 --> 07:39.360
which woman wouldn't want her husband

07:39.360 --> 07:40.480
to be handsome, brave,

07:40.720 --> 07:42.480
talented, and capable?

07:42.800 --> 07:44.000
This mouth of yours

07:44.600 --> 07:46.240
is indeed your greatest talent.

07:48.839 --> 07:51.759
So, do you like it, Your Majesty?

07:52.279 --> 07:52.959
I don't.

07:54.680 --> 07:58.199
But I love Your Majesty's mouth.

08:00.759 --> 08:02.079
Your Majesty's mouth is stubborn.

08:06.279 --> 08:07.560
How thick-skinned.

08:09.959 --> 08:11.720
I am only thick-skinned
for Your Majesty.

08:12.000 --> 08:13.760
I would never be
this way with anyone else.

08:14.079 --> 08:14.959
Because Your Majesty

08:15.120 --> 08:16.639
is the finest man in the world.

08:17.759 --> 08:18.560
Shen Zhinian,

08:19.839 --> 08:20.759
you'd better

08:21.240 --> 08:23.199
have never said
these words to another man.

08:24.399 --> 08:25.519
I swear,

08:25.879 --> 08:27.439
I have only said them to you.

08:27.439 --> 08:31.260
♪Dim lamps, concerns unheard by anyone♪

08:32.180 --> 08:37.740
♪All the spring colors
lean toward one person♪

08:38.440 --> 08:41.480
Do you realize that deceiving
the Emperor is a capital offense?

08:42.620 --> 08:45.980
♪Every step is treacherous,
regardless of the world♪

08:45.980 --> 08:49.980
♪Flowers wither easily,
but obsession remains♪

08:51.399 --> 08:52.759
I may love to joke,

08:53.000 --> 08:54.840
but one thing is true.

08:55.960 --> 08:58.679
I really like you very much, Your Majesty.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.440
Shen Zhinian,

09:05.600 --> 09:08.240
you'd better be able
to keep up this act forever.

09:09.660 --> 09:12.860
♪I don't ask for equality,
only that you hear me♪

09:12.860 --> 09:16.380
♪Years of longing haunt
the palace gates, too deep to hide♪

09:16.380 --> 09:19.820
♪I endured the years,
guarding a single truth♪

09:19.820 --> 09:23.260
♪Spending my youth on deep love,
asking not of right or wrong♪

09:23.260 --> 09:26.340
♪Though rumors cover the bed,
my heart is sincere♪

09:26.340 --> 09:31.660
♪Only wishing to stay by your side,
never betraying this bond of fate♪

09:38.799 --> 09:41.480
The Emperor has visited twice
but hasn't stayed the night.

09:41.519 --> 09:43.240
Could he really have
some hidden ailment?

10:05.639 --> 10:06.600
It doesn't seem like it.

10:07.440 --> 10:09.080
I don't understand why either.

10:09.080 --> 10:11.399
Every time it reaches
a critical moment, he stops.

10:12.279 --> 10:13.039
Perhaps,

10:14.840 --> 10:16.600
he still doesn't trust me.

10:17.159 --> 10:19.159
Young Lady, why did you tell His Majesty

10:19.159 --> 10:21.000
about your marriage to Lu Jianglin?

10:21.879 --> 10:23.799
My marriage to him isn't a secret.

10:23.800 --> 10:25.500
His Majesty would
find out sooner or later.

10:25.519 --> 10:26.890
It's better that I tell him myself.

10:27.360 --> 10:28.960
But what if His Majesty really thinks

10:28.960 --> 10:31.280
you're someone who favors
the rich and disdains the poor?

10:32.799 --> 10:34.799
Since it's His Majesty's wealth
that I love,

10:35.759 --> 10:37.279
he will only be happy.

10:37.440 --> 10:39.759
It's a man's nature to enjoy conquest.

10:42.840 --> 10:44.879
Senior Attendant, a pigeon just flew in.

10:46.600 --> 10:47.840
Isn't this Lu Jianglin's pigeon?

10:47.840 --> 10:48.480
Drive it away.

10:48.480 --> 10:49.039
Yes.

10:50.080 --> 10:51.480
Lu Jianglin is so indiscreet.

10:51.500 --> 10:52.399
It will cause trouble.

10:53.600 --> 10:54.799
I must find a way

10:55.240 --> 10:56.080
to send him away.

11:04.840 --> 11:07.120
Could it really be as Nanqiao said

11:07.660 --> 11:09.559
that she favors the rich
and disdains the poor,

11:09.840 --> 11:11.960
so she abandoned me?

11:17.480 --> 11:19.440
Shen Zhinian,

11:20.120 --> 11:22.279
I treated you with sincerity.

11:22.799 --> 11:24.720
How could you betray me?

11:24.860 --> 11:28.220
(Tinglan Palace)

11:30.480 --> 11:32.639
Young Lady,
why do you use a bell to catch insects?

11:32.639 --> 11:33.960
This is an insect-catching bell.

11:34.320 --> 11:36.600
Its sound can trick the insects

11:36.799 --> 11:38.679
into thinking
it's a female's mating call.

11:39.100 --> 11:41.970
Can this really attract the insects
the little white snake likes to eat?

11:42.690 --> 11:44.480
I looked through
ancient records last night.

11:44.639 --> 11:46.399
The insects the little white snake likes

11:46.399 --> 11:47.559
are unique on Mount Tian.

11:47.560 --> 11:49.790
Since it's hiding in the Tinglan Palace
and won't leave,

11:50.039 --> 11:51.080
it means there must be

11:51.159 --> 11:52.919
the insects it likes here.

11:53.799 --> 11:56.320
If you help His Majesty raise the snake,
he will be happy.

11:56.799 --> 11:58.399
Whether he's happy is one thing,

11:58.400 --> 12:00.039
but the little white snake
will be happy.

12:01.200 --> 12:03.399
If I can't win His Majesty's favor,

12:03.500 --> 12:05.080
I'll just kidnap the little white snake.

12:05.080 --> 12:06.480
Selling it for money
would also sustain me.

12:08.559 --> 12:10.080
Come give me the cage.

12:11.320 --> 12:12.120
Your hand...

12:18.600 --> 12:19.559
Why are you here again?

12:20.000 --> 12:23.279
Hadn't I come, you would have
kidnapped my little white snake

12:23.279 --> 12:24.230
without me even knowing.

12:25.159 --> 12:27.480
It's raising, not kidnapping.

12:27.660 --> 12:29.000
Doesn't Your Majesty want to know

12:29.000 --> 12:30.679
what the little white snake
likes to eat?

12:31.399 --> 12:33.519
You should be glad
it doesn't like to eat you.

12:33.879 --> 12:35.600
Otherwise, I would have to kill you

12:35.960 --> 12:37.600
and feed it with your blood.

12:42.480 --> 12:44.759
If it really wanted to eat me,

12:45.639 --> 12:47.000
would Your Majesty

12:47.399 --> 12:48.720
really kill me?

12:59.680 --> 13:04.800
♪Broken dreams,
listening to the light rain♪

13:06.520 --> 13:11.760
♪Bitter cold, bringing mist to the eyes♪

13:13.400 --> 13:15.760
♪If we don't meet♪

13:15.960 --> 13:19.200
♪Flowers bloom and fall in shame♪

13:19.400 --> 13:25.920
♪If we meet again,
the peaches will be warm♪

13:26.280 --> 13:32.720
♪Spring breeze passes,
dancing through the years♪

13:33.080 --> 13:39.400
♪Brewing longing,
remembering past lives♪

13:39.920 --> 13:46.600
♪Hard to meet, and just as hard to part♪

13:46.600 --> 13:53.480
♪Who planted the beans
that grew into lotuses?♪

13:53.720 --> 13:59.600
♪Spring breeze passes,
composing the fleeting years♪

14:00.520 --> 14:07.120
♪Clouds on Mount Wu,
no sails on the sea♪

14:07.280 --> 14:13.960
♪Wanting to fold
my heart into a paper kite♪

14:14.240 --> 14:20.680
♪But the ties are too tangled to sever♪
